{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0098-validate-bst","title":"LeetCode 98 验证二叉搜索树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0098-validate-bst","wordCount":907,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-98-验证二叉搜索树\">LeetCode 98 验证二叉搜索树</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个二叉树的根节点 <code>root</code>，判断其是否是一个有效的二叉搜索树。</p>\n<p><strong>有效的二叉搜索树定义如下：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>节点的左子树只包含<strong>小于</strong>当前节点的数</li>\n<li>节点的右子树只包含<strong>大于</strong>当前节点的数</li>\n<li>所有左子树和右子树自身必须也是二叉搜索树</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>root = [2,1,3]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>true</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>root = [5,1,4,null,null,3,6]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>false</code></li>\n<li>解释：根节点的值是 5，但右子节点的值是 4。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>树中节点数目范围在 <code>[1, 10^4]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-2^31 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 2^31 - 1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本题常见的错误是只比较节点与其直接子节点的大小关系。例如 <code>[5,4,6,null,null,3,7]</code> 中，节点 3 虽然是 6 的左子节点（3 &lt; 6），但它在根节点 5 的右子树中，必须大于 5，因此该树不是有效 BST。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-递归传递上下界\">方法一：递归传递上下界</h3><p>正确的做法是为每个节点维护一个有效的取值范围 <code>(lower, upper)</code>。根节点的范围是 <code>(-∞, +∞)</code>，左子节点的上界更新为父节点的值，右子节点的下界更新为父节点的值。</p>\n<p>递归过程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>如果节点为空，返回 <code>true</code></li>\n<li>如果节点值 ≤ lower 或 ≥ upper，返回 <code>false</code></li>\n<li>递归验证左子树（upper 更新为当前值）和右子树（lower 更新为当前值）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"方法二-中序遍历\">方法二：中序遍历</h3><p>BST 的中序遍历结果是严格递增序列。因此可以对树进行中序遍历，检查每个元素是否大于前一个元素。</p>\n<p>这种方法的优势是思路直观，不需要维护复杂的边界参数。只需记录上一个访问的值 <code>prev</code>，每次比较即可。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上下界递归</td>\n<td>传递有效范围</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中序遍历</td>\n<td>验证有序性</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 h 为树的高度，最坏情况下 h = n（退化为链表）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-递归上下界\">方法一：递归上下界</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class TreeNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  left: TreeNode | null;&#10;  right: TreeNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, left?: TreeNode | null, right?: TreeNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.left = left ?? null;&#10;    this.right = right ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function isValidBST(root: TreeNode | null): boolean {&#10;  const validate = (node: TreeNode | null, lower: number, upper: number): boolean =&gt; {&#10;    if (node === null) return true;&#10;    if (node.val &lt;= lower || node.val &gt;= upper) return false;&#10;    return validate(node.left, lower, node.val) &amp;&amp; validate(node.right, node.val, upper);&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return validate(root, -Infinity, Infinity);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isValidBST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span s